    uid-separation + mode-protected column, and **`KNOWN_LIMITATION`** in the
    world-readable column. The world-readable case was carried into PE-06a′ by an
    over-broad summary, not by a distinct argument.
  - The `require_uid_separation` mechanism row and the residual list were updated to
    match, and `OSS_RESEARCH_EVIDENCE.md §8` item 8 gained residual **(d)**. The
    item's "Two residuals remain" count was corrected to **four** (a)–(d), since the
  stale count contradicted the four listed residuals in the same paragraph.

FIX 3 (new defect — dependency contradiction) — the graph and the prose now agree.
