  - `OSS_RESEARCH_EVIDENCE.md §8` numbering re-verified continuous
    (`1 … 9, 9a 9b 9c 9d 9e 9f, 10, 11`); the 9e/9f ordering left out of round 11
    is now in the correct order.

  The round-11 note claimed the post-fix sweep had caught the one residual
  `DENY`. It did — in `OSS_RESEARCH_EVIDENCE.md`. It did not sweep the other five
  documents, which is where the round-12 residuals actually were. The sweep is
