THE DECISIVE FINDING: ROUND 30 REPEATED THE REVIEW'S OWN DEFECT
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Round 30's blocking checks were not a new class of failure. They were this
review's own signature defect, committed by my round-30 edits:

  F30a replaced the TAIL of P1a (1c) and appended a block explaining that (1c)
  is no longer a gate -- while (1c)'s OPENING sentence still read "the residual
  is detected..." and a sentence twelve lines below still read "Until that
